<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Our Platform!</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            direction: ltr;
            text-align: left;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid #eef2f5;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 10px 0 0;
            font-size: 15px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 35px 30px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .features-box {
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-left: 4px solid #4f46e5;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        }
        .features-box ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .features-box li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #4b5563;
        }
        .btn-wrapper {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 35px 0 20px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #4f46e5;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3);
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Welcome to Our Platform! 🎉</h1>
            <p>We're thrilled to have you join our community</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hi <%= username %>,</div>
            <p>
                Your account has been successfully created. We are excited to have you on board and are committed to giving you the best experience possible.
            </p>

            <div class="features-box">
                <strong>What can you do next?</strong>
                <ul>
                    <li>Browse and explore all available products.</li>
                    <li>Share your reviews and feedback on products.</li>
                    <li>Update your profile details and upload an avatar at any time.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="btn-wrapper">
                <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="btn">Get Started Now</a>
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 25px;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is always here to help.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2026 Learning NestJS. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>If you did not create this account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
